<title>USA: Blue Cross of Western NY seeks 22.8 pct rate rise.</title>
<headline>Blue Cross of Western NY seeks 22.8 pct rate rise.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-11-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>The New York State Insurance Department said on Wednesday that it scheduled a public hearing to consider a request by  New York Care Plus Insurance Co Inc for a 22.8 percent rate increase.</p>
<p>The company does business as Blue Cross and Blue Shield of Western New York.</p>
<p>The hearing will take place in the Walter J. Mahoney State Office Building in Buffalo, N.Y., at 1000 EST/1500 GMT December 9. -- New York Newsdesk 212-859-1610.</p>
</text>
